OL,3,GNEWSAReform boycotts Senedd after
OL,4,Amember banned for saying white people
OL,5,Abeing replaced
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform politicians will partially
OL,8,Fboycott the Senedd to protest the ban
OL,9,Fof one of their politicians for
OL,10,Fclaiming white people are being
OL,11,F"replaced" in the UK.
OL,13,FThe party's Welsh leader, Helen Jenner,
OL,14,Fsaid Joe Martin's ban was because of
OL,15,F"undue pressure" from governing party
OL,16,FPlaid Cymru and was an "infringement on
OL,17,Ffreedom of speech". Reform UK leader
OL,18,FNigel Farage called the ruling
OL,19,F"ridiculous and outrageous".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
