OL,3,GNEWSAReform boycotts Senedd after
OL,4,Amember banned for saying white people
OL,5,Abeing replaced
OL,6,
OL,7,FMartin had been told he would not be
OL,8,Fallowed to speak in the Senedd's
OL,9,Fchamber until he apologised for the
OL,10,Fremarks, which the parliament's
OL,11,FPresiding Officer Huw Irranca-Davies
OL,12,Fcalled "unnecessarily provocative and
OL,13,Fdeliberately offensive".
OL,15,FReform said its members would withdraw
OL,16,Ffrom most of Wednesday's proceedings
OL,17,Fbefore returning to vote later in the
OL,18,Fevening.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
